# CVEs excluded from the CI CRITICAL gate only (the HIGH+CRITICAL report still shows them).
# Justify every entry and remove once fixed

# node-tar gzip bomb DoS
# npm's bundled tar in the node base umage and bcrypts' node-pre-gym
# neither are used to extract untrusted archives from users but should still be fixed
# Remove when node image/npm ships tar > 7.5.19 and bcrypt is bumped
CVE-2026-59873

# golang.org/x/crypto/ssh auth bypass (unenforced source-address restrictions),
# bundled in the caddy binary (apps/front-end/Dockerfile). Fixed upstream in
# x/crypto v0.55.0, but no Caddy release pulls it in yet. Not reachable here regardless:
# this image only uses Caddy as a static file server + HTTP reverse proxy, never
# its SSH client/server. 
# Remove once a Caddy release ships x/crypto >= 0.55.0.
CVE-2026-56854
